# Agent worktrees. 341 MB of full repo copies, and `vitest run` walks into them:
# a bare `npm test` picks up the duplicated src/ and reports ~1420 tests instead
# of ~950, with ~63 phantom failures from the older copy's components. Ignored so
# neither `git add -A` nor a test run can be misled by them.
.claude/worktrees/

